      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think a good initial step in this direction might be granting access to avatars, like how read player me appears to work. So you upload avatar to your account as private but can grant other users access to it. I'm surprised there has been no expansion.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
